<title>UK: Chubb names Jones European president.</title>
<headline>Chubb names Jones European president.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chubb Corp said in a statement that it has appointed Ralph Jones III president of its European operations, Chubb Insurance Company of Europe (CICE).</p>
<p>Jones is also chief underwriting officer for CICE and is based at Royal Mint Court in London.</p>
<p>CICE has 22 offices in nine countries. Its Gross premium income has tripled since 1990 and is estimated at $450 million for 1996.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Insurance News 44 171 542 2769</p>
</text>
